  "player_hint_1_en": "Suppose Archie were at row 1, column 1: then Cecily would have nowhere left to go. So Archie can't be there. So Archie (A) must be at row 2, column 1. Cross out his row and column.",
  "player_hint_2_en": "With the rows and columns of Archie crossed out, only one square is left for Cecily that fits her clue (\"She was in the Farmhouse Kitchen, but not beside the table.\"). So Cecily (C) must be at row 1, column 2. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_3_en": "With the rows and columns of Archie and Cecily crossed out, only one square is left for Edgar that fits his clue (\"He was beside the water.\"). So Edgar (E) must be at row 5, column 3. Cross out his row and column.",
  "player_hint_4_en": "With the rows and columns of everyone placed so far crossed out, only one square is left for Bonnie that fits her clue (\"She was the only person in a car.\"). So Bonnie (B) must be at row 9, column 4. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_5_en": "Holly can't be at row 4, column 6; row 6, column 6: in each case Gloria would have nowhere left to go. So Holly (H) must be at row 6, column 5. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_6_en": "Suppose Dinah were at row 3, column 6: then Gloria would have nowhere left to go. So Dinah can't be there. Suppose Dinah were at row 3, column 8: then nobody could stand in column 7. So Dinah can't be there. So Dinah (D) must be at row 4, column 9. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_7_en": "Fiona is now the only person who can still go in row 7. So Fiona (F) must be at row 7, column 8. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_8_en": "With the rows and columns of everyone placed so far crossed out, only one square is left for Gloria that fits her clue (\"She was in the sixth column.\"). So Gloria (G) must be at row 8, column 6. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_9_en": "With the rows and columns of everyone placed so far crossed out, only one square is left for Vince. So Vince (the victim) must be at row 3, column 7. Cross out his row and column. Dinah is the only person in the Barn with Vince, so Dinah is the murderer!"
